EX3     START   3000
BUF     RESB    20
MSG     BYTE    X'48656C6C6F'   . "Hello" (hex)
COUNT   WORD    10
        LDA     COUNT
        SUB     ONE
        STA     COUNT
        COMP    ZERO
        JEQ     DONE
        J       EX3
ONE     WORD    1
ZERO    WORD    0
DONE    RSUB
        END     EX3
